Changes to sing-box v1.14.4 (GNU GPL v3.0 or later), made by the unbraid authors, last on 2026-10-21:
a connection opened for an app by another process (WebKit for Safari, nsurlsessiond for
downloads) counts as that app's.
Applied by tools/build-libbox.sh; git apply skips these lines.

